{
  "uid": "unifabric-workload-pair-sflow-zh",
  "title": "Unifabric 工作负载 src 到 dst sFlow",
  "description": "基于存储在 Elasticsearch 中的 sFlow 采样数据，查看一对工作负载之间的流量。",
  "tags": [
    "unifabric",
    "sflow"
